.TH tkustatus n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkustatus \- status bar widget
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkustatus
.br
set st [::tkutils::tkustatus::widget .st]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A status bar with a main message, named fields and an optional progress bar. See
docs/tkustatus.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, statusbar
